      "excerpts": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "text": "-- Dungeon Finder: every Ascension wing dungeon gets its final boss, so finishing it completes the"
        },
        {
          "line": 2,
          "text": "-- dungeon and gives the random dungeon reward. Final bosses are the ones the client names for each"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "text": "-- wing in DungeonEncounterExtra.dbc. The whole-dungeon entries these bosses ended before"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "text": "-- (1 Wailing Caverns, 2 Scholomance, 14 Gnomeregan, 22 Uldaman) are level 100 in LFGDungeons.dbc."
        },
