        {
          "line": 1,
          "text": "-- AzerothCore spawns these dungeon rares only some of the time: a row on AI init despawns them again with a 50-90 %"
        },
        {
          "line": 2,
          "text": "-- chance. On Ascension they are fixed encounters (all have an `instance_encounters` row, most an Ascension kit), and"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "text": "--  4842 Earthcaller Halmgar      5912 Brightwing              6228 Dark Iron Ambassador    7354 Ragglesnout"
        },
        {
          "line": 12,
          "text": "      AND `entryorguid` IN (1720, 3586, 3872, 4425, 4842, 5912, 6228, 7354, 8923, 9217, 9218, 9219, 9596, 10080,"
        }
      ]
